            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Zirn 1.0.3 (RC)</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Lowered minimum macOS requirement to 26.0</li>
  <li>Improved release signing for distribution outside the App Store</li>
  <li>First launch: right-click Zirn → Open once; after that it opens normally</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
