            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Zirn 1.0.2 (RC)</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Fixed assistant input bar alignment and clipped send button</li>
  <li>Centered the model label in the prompt pill</li>
  <li>Improved iCloud Keychain access for saved Mistral API keys</li>
  <li>Block creating a brain in folders that already contain a vault</li>
  <li>Post-update popup now shows this changelog after a successful update</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
